note Prompt-level strict accuracy (evaluation_lib.py test_instruction_following_strict): every
note instruction must hold and the response must not be blank. PREREG.md section 5 lists the
note 19 supported instruction ids and the deviations D1 (ASCII lowercase) and D2 (\w ranges).

